category: Libs
requires: cygwin-devel libbson2-devel libmongoc2_2 pkg-config
sdesc: "High-performance MongoDB driver for C (development)"
ldesc: "The MongoDB C Driver, also known as “libmongoc”, is a library for using
MongoDB from C applications, and for writing MongoDB drivers in higher-level
languages."
external-source: mongo-c-driver

